# Pages & Features

## Required routes

| Route | Access | Features |
|-------|--------|----------|
| `/login`, `/register` | Public | Email/password auth |
| `/dashboard` | Auth | Task overview, team stats; export button (admin/manager) |
| `/tasks` | Auth | List + filters (status, priority, assigned_to), pagination |
| `/tasks/:id` | Auth | View/edit; status transitions; role-limited fields |
| `/teams` | Admin, Manager | List/create teams, manage members |
| `/users` | Admin, Manager | List/create/edit users; admin toggles any role |
| `/analytics` | Admin, Manager | Charts from Node API; `team_id` required |
| `/settings` | Auth | Profile / preferences |

## Task UI rules

- Team member: no create button, no assignee picker, no delete
- Status dropdown must respect transitions (pending→in_progress/cancelled, etc.)
- Export modal: CSV / JSON / XLSX + filters → Node `POST /export/tasks`

## State

- `AuthContext`: `{ user, token, login, logout, isLoading }`
- User type includes `id`, `name`, `email`, `role`, `is_active`
